__pycache__/          ← Python's compiled bytecode files (auto-generated)
*.py[cod]             ← .pyc .pyo .pyd compiled files
*.egg-info/           ← Package metadata (not needed)
.env                  ← Your secrets/passwords (NEVER push this!)
.venv/ venv/          ← Virtual environment folder (huge, not needed)
dist/ build/          ← Build artifacts
.pytest_cache/        ← Pytest temp files
.ruff_cache/          ← Linter temp files
coverage.xml          ← Test coverage reports
*.log                 ← Log files